# Narrow allows for known false positives of a privacy scan (one regex per line; matched against the hit or
# "<path>:<line>"). Keep every line generic.
# Placeholder users in examples and tests, the same ones .gitleaks.toml allows.
^/Users/(?:(?:you|me|user|username|name)\b|<[^>]*>)
# Engine constants named LOCAL (the "local" visibility), not *.local hostnames.
^(?:plugins|source)\.LOCAL$
